he's, like, a medium to large man.

187
00:07:52,150 --> 00:07:54,550
或许那是他的"假日发福后"专用裤
Maybe those are his "after the holiday" pants,

188
00:07:54,550 --> 00:07:56,390
你也有啊
like you have.

189
00:07:56,810 --> 00:07:57,990
我也不知道了
I don't know.

190
00:07:57,990 --> 00:07:59,830
你们觉得她是不是太快开始约会了
I mean, do you think it's too soon for her to be dating?

191
00:07:59,830 --> 00:08:01,300
如果你和伯纳黛特分手了
If you and Bernadette broke up,

192
00:08:01,300 --> 00:08:02,420
你会等多久才开始约会
like, how long would you wait?

193
00:08:02,420 --> 00:08:03,530
我都不想去想这种问题
Oh, well, I don't even want to think...

194
00:08:03,530 --> 00:08:05,020
八天
Eight days.

195
00:08:06,910 --> 00:08:07,710
什么
What?

196
00:08:07,710 --> 00:08:10,330
在家哭两天  健身房恢复身材六天
Two days to cry. Six days to hit the gym.

197
00:08:10,810 --> 00:08:13,160
首先你身材已经很棒了
First of all, you already look amazing.

198
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:15,070
嘴真甜
Aw, that's sweet.

199
00:08:15,070 --> 00:08:17,950
那我再多为他哭一天吧
I'm gonna give him an extra day of crying.

200
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:22,350
不就是不
The answer is still no.

201
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:29,220
随你说我们不会察觉到你在  但我们就是能
You can say we wouldn't know you're here, but we'd know.

202
00:08:30,350 --> 00:08:32,920
因为你就会在这里啊
Because you'd be here!

203
00:08:33,790 --> 00:08:37,610
是谁的电话呀
So, who was that?

204
00:08:37,610 --> 00:08:40,660
真不敢相信你居然挂我电话
I can't believe you hung up on me!

205
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:42,830
什么鬼
What the hell?

206
00:08:42,830 --> 00:08:45,010
你在我们家干嘛
What are you doing here?

207
00:08:45,010 --> 00:08:46,320
我是来证明你是错的
I am proving you wrong.

208
00:08:46,330 --> 00:08:47,900
我已经在里面工作好几个小时了
I've been working back there for hours.

209
00:08:47,900 --> 00:08:49,900
你们根本没察觉
You had no idea.

210
00:08:50,220 --> 00:08:51,490
帮帮忙
Do something.

211
00:08:51,490 --> 00:08:54,190
什么鬼  你在我们家干嘛
What the hell? What are you doing here?

212
00:08:54,620 --> 00:08:56,850
我在试着尊重艾米
I-I am trying to respect Amy.

213
00:08:56,850 --> 00:08:58,180
好吧  你在学校有自己的办公室
Okay, look, you have an office at work.

214
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,560
你怎么不去那办公
Why don't you go there?

215
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:01,860
我不能每次一有灵感就冲去学校办公室啊
I can't go to the office every time I have a brilliant thought.

216
00:09:01,860 --> 00:09:03,180
那我岂不是相当于住那儿了
I'd basically be living there.

217
00:09:03,180 --> 00:09:05,390
听起来不错  去吧
Sounds good, do that.

218
00:09:05,390 --> 00:09:07,730
不行  校园晚上不安全
No. No, the campus isn't safe at night.

219
00:09:07,730 --> 00:09:09,880
那里不但有浣熊  还有大学生到处走
There's raccoons and undergrads just walking around

220
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:12,000
好像那是他们的地盘一样
like they own the place.

221
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,020
听着
Look.

222
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:14,760
我需要一个可以晚上工作的地方
I need somewhere to work in the evenings.

223
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:16,410
而你们正好有不用的房间
You have a space you aren't using.

224
00:09:16,410 --> 00:09:20,330
看一眼我的提议
Just take a look at my proposal.

225
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:21,720
这是什么
What is this?

226
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,780
租赁协议
A rental agreement.

227
00:09:22,780 --> 00:09:24,620
这间房间我仅用于办公
I will only use the room for work.

228
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:26,650
我不会睡这里  我不会吃你们的食物
I-I won't sleep here, I won't eat your food,

229
00:09:26,650 --> 00:09:27,850
我甚至不会用你们的洗手间
I won't even use your bathroom.

230
00:09:27,850 --> 00:09:30,780
你从此就能无论白天黑夜想来就来吗
So you can just walk in any time of the day or night?

231
00:09:30,780 --> 00:09:32,140
他现在不就这样吗
Well, he does that now.

232
00:09:32,140 --> 00:09:34,830
至少签了协议我们还有钱拿
At least this way we'll get paid.

233
00:09:36,580 --> 00:09:38,790
我是拉杰什·库萨帕里博士
I am Dr. Rajesh Koothrappali,

234
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:41,770
感谢各位与我一起
and thank you for taking a walk with me...

235
00:09:45,010 --> 00:09:46,820
...漫步群星之中
...through the stars.

236
00:09:48,070 --> 00:09:50,700
我觉得刚才那停顿太长了
I-I think that one was too long.

237
00:09:51,110 --> 00:09:52,980
你说得对  我也感觉到了
Yeah, you're right. I totally felt it.

238
00:09:52,990 --> 00:09:54,250
我们要不再来一遍
Should we, uh, run it again?

239
00:09:54,250 --> 00:09:56,060
天啊  不要了吧
Please, God, no.

240
00:09:59,180 --> 00:10:00,240
需要帮忙吗
Can I help you?

241
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:03,330
你们俩谁是拉杰什·库萨帕里
Which one of you is Rajesh Koothrappali?

242
00:10:03,330 --> 00:10:04,520
不是吧  你看不出来
Really? You're not sure

243
00:10:04,520 --> 00:10:07,090
我们俩谁是拉杰什·库萨帕里吗
which one of us is Rajesh Koothrappali?

244
00:10:08,610 --> 00:10:13,130
看出来了  我只是不想弄得像种族歧视
I am. I was just trying not to be racist.

245
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:17,430
我是妮尔的老公
I'm Nell's husband.

246
00:10:21,050 --> 00:10:23,590
是这样的  我真不知道
h-here's the thing-- I didn't know

247
00:10:23,590 --> 00:10:25,640
她已经结婚了  是事后...
that she was married until after...

248
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:27,240
什么事之后
After what?

249
00:10:30,450 --> 00:10:31,450
我
I'm...

250
00:10:31,450 --> 00:10:33,470
真的非常对不起
I'm really sorry.

251
00:10:33,470 --> 00:10:35,460
道歉并不会让我好过点
Well, that doesn't make me feel better.

252
00:10:35,460 --> 00:10:36,900
那做什么能让你好过点
Wh-What would make you feel better?

253
00:10:36,900 --> 00:10:38,610
我要你不再和我老婆来往
I want you to stop seeing my wife.

254
00:10:38,610 --> 00:10:40,640
没问题  很高兴认识你  再见
Done. Nice to meet you. Bye.

255
00:10:42,050 --> 00:10:44,200
我该怎么办
What am I gonna do?

256
00:10:50,880 --> 00:10:54,300
大兄弟  你想聊聊吗
Hey, buddy, do-do you want to talk?

257
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:59,320
我本以为我们会结婚生子
I thought we were gonna start a family.

258
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:01,490
没想到措不及防  感情玩完
Next thing I know, it's over.

259
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:05,040
一切都会好的
It's gonna be okay.

260
00:11:05,370 --> 00:11:06,490
怎么可能会好
How is it gonna be okay?

261
00:11:06,490 --> 00:11:08,900
你睡了我老婆
You're sleeping with my wife.

262
00:11:10,460 --> 00:11:12,990
我是说  除了这事之外
I mean, besides that.

263
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,630
你需要点什么吗
Can I get you anything?

264
00:11:23,630 --> 00:11:25,260
来杯水
A glass of water?

265
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,870
还是来场激光秀
A laser show?

266
00:11:28,070 --> 00:11:29,080
-不必  谢了  -太好了
No, thank you. ?Oh, good.

267
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:32,490
因为我根本不知道开关在哪
'Cause I don't, I don't even know how to turn it on.

268
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,730
抱歉
I'm sorry.

269
00:11:33,730 --> 00:11:35,640
我不该来这里
I shouldn't have come here.

270
00:11:36,370 --> 00:11:39,680
可能我只是想看看取代我的人是谁
I guess I just wanted to see who she replaced me with.

271
00:11:39,680 --> 00:11:41,330
别这么说
Don't say that.

272
00:11:41,330 --> 00:11:42,970
你们俩的感情很特别
What you two had was special.

273
00:11:42,970 --> 00:11:44,790
谁也取代不了你
No one can replace you.

274
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:45,900
这话是她说的吗
Did she say that?

275
00:11:45,900 --> 00:11:47,350
不是
No.

276
00:11:49,950 --> 00:11:50,830
我该走了  对吧
I should go, right?

277
00:11:50,830 --> 00:11:51,430
别走
Stay.

278
00:11:51,430 --> 00:11:53,020
好的  晚点联系
Okay, I'll call you later.

279
00:11:55,540 --> 00:11:57,300
听着  如果这么说能让你好过点
Look, if it makes you feel any better,

280
00:11:57,300 --> 00:11:59,600
我跟她一点都不熟
I barely know her.

281
00:11:59,610 --> 00:12:01,930
不熟她还跟你睡吗
And she had sex with you?

282
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,290
妮尔说你是名消防员
Nell tells me you're a fireman.

283
00:12:04,300 --> 00:12:05,960
都做些什么呀
What's that like?

284
00:12:14,690 --> 00:12:17,100
好吧  知道他在房间里面
Okay, I-I-I'm really uncomfortable

285
00:12:17,100 --> 00:12:18,620
我真的很不舒服
with him back in that room.

286
00:12:18,620 --> 00:12:20,490
为什么  他一天都没出来了
Why? He hasn't made a peep all day.

287
00:12:20,490 --> 00:12:21,340
你不懂
Y-Y-You don't get it.

288
00:12:21,340 --> 00:12:23,330
我跟谢尔顿住了那么多年
All the years that we lived together,

289
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:25,380
他总是能把我弄疯
he drove me crazy the whole time.

290
00:12:25,380 --> 00:12:28,220
而现在却乖乖的
And now he's not.

291
00:12:28,710 --> 00:12:30,160
对啊
Exactly.

292
00:12:31,340 --> 00:12:32,640
别用那种眼神看着我
D-Don't look at me like that.

293
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:35,390
这代表他是故意的
It-it-it means he did it on purpose.

294
00:12:35,390 --> 00:12:36,890
那是他的选择
It was a choice.

295
00:12:36,890 --> 00:12:40,020
就像发现哥斯拉本来可以吃个阿比三明治
That-That's like finding out Godzilla could've had Arby's

296
00:12:40,030 --> 00:12:41,970
结果却故意去毁东京一样
instead of Tokyo.

297
00:12:43,630 --> 00:12:45,100
我想日本应该没有阿比三明治店
I don't think they have Arby's in Japan.

298
00:12:45,100 --> 00:12:46,860
这不是重点
Not my point.

299
00:12:49,750 --> 00:12:51,070
谢尔顿
Sheldon.

300
00:12:51,690 --> 00:12:53,030
谢尔顿
Sheldon!

301
00:12:54,140 --> 00:12:56,890
抱歉  我是不是太大声了
I'm sorry. Am I being too loud?

302
00:12:57,910 --> 00:13:00,710
不是  你表现得很完美  你心知肚明
No, you're being perfect and you know it.

303
00:13:00,710 --> 00:13:04,230
你希望我当一个不那么良心的租客吗
Would you like me to be a less considerate tenant?

304
00:13:04,470 --> 00:13:06,590
不是  是的  什...
No. Yes. What...?

305
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:08,460
别再逼疯我了
Stop messing with me!

306
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,440
我错了
Hey, I was wrong.

307
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:15,230
阿比三明治在冲绳有分店
There's an Arby's in Okinawa.

308
00:13:20,170 --> 00:13:22,020
他以前跟她哥哥是死党
He was best friends with her older brother,

309
00:13:22,020 --> 00:13:23,470
但他当时根本没注意到她
but he didn't even notice her.

310
00:13:23,470 --> 00:13:24,610
几年后
And then years afterward,

311
00:13:24,610 --> 00:13:27,230
他们在车管所偶遇了对方
they randomly bumped into each other at the DMV.

312
00:13:27,230 --> 00:13:29,700
两小时后  他们就坠入爱河了
Two hours later, they were in love.

313
00:13:29,700 --> 00:13:33,220
你能从他驾驶证照片中看到眼里爱的火花
You can really see the sparkle in his license photo.

314
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:36,110
这些都是他在天文馆跟你说的吗
He told you all this at the planetarium?

315
00:13:36,110 --> 00:13:37,480
不不  我们去馅饼屋了
No, no, we went to House of Pies.

316
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:39,150
他点了香蕉奶油  我点了椰子口味
He got banana cream. I got coconut.

317
00:13:39,150 --> 00:13:40,910
我们分着吃
We did halfsies.

318
00:13:41,620 --> 00:13:44,510
你跟另一个男人分吃一块馅饼吗
You did pie halfsies with another man?

319
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:46,910
你是指除你以外的男人吗
You mean other than you?

320
00:13:49,060 --> 00:13:50,270
是啊
Yeah.

321
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:53,550
我很同情他  妮妮
I feel bad for him, Bernie.

322
00:13:53,550 --> 00:13:55,040
他是个好人
He's a, he's a good guy.

323
00:13:55,040 --> 00:13:56,340
如果你觉得不舒服
Well, if you're uncomfortable with it,

324
00:13:56,340 --> 00:13:57,830
也许就别再跟他老婆上床了
maybe stop sleeping with his wife.

325
00:13:57,830 --> 00:13:59,330
我觉得性不是问题所在
I don't think the sex is the problem.

326
00:13:59,330 --> 00:14:02,630
我很肯定相比起来我表现一般
I know for a fact I was just okay.

327
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:06,710
我想说馅饼屋这店是我带你认识的
For the record, I'm the one who introduced you to House of Pies.

328
00:14:09,850 --> 00:14:10,470
谢尔顿
Sheldon?

329
00:14:10,470 --> 00:14:12,280
是莱纳德啊
Oh, Leonard.

330
00:14:13,100 --> 00:14:15,390
抱歉  我必须离开那里
Sorry, I just, I had to get out of there.

331
00:14:15,390 --> 00:14:16,440
他又做了什么
What did he do now?

332
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:19,030
啥都没做  他简直是天使
Nothing. He's being a dream.

333
00:14:20,930 --> 00:14:21,780
别那样看着我
Don't give me that look.

334
00:14:21,780 --> 00:14:24,040
佩妮就是用那种眼神看我  我没疯
That's how Penny looked at me. I'm not crazy.

335
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:26,030
佩妮和我的"你疯了"眼神一样吗
Penny and I have the same "You're crazy" look?

336
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:27,730
好甜好有爱
That's kind of sweet.

337
00:14:28,900 --> 00:14:31,380
我懂得如何对付真实的谢尔顿
I know how to deal with Sheldon being Sheldon,

338
00:14:31,380 --> 00:14:34,720
但表现得理智又体贴的谢尔顿
but Sheldon being a-a rational, thoughtful person?

339
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:36,710
我都懵了
I'm clueless. I-It's like

340
00:14:36,710 --> 00:14:39,100
就像去年我妈打给我  唱生日歌给我听
when my mom called last year to sing happy birthday

341
00:14:39,100 --> 00:14:41,620
我直接吐了
and I-I just threw up.

342
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:44,140
如果太难以忍受
Well, if it gets to be too much,

343
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:46,050
你随时可以把他赶回来这里
you can always send him back over here.

344
00:14:46,050 --> 00:14:47,160
我和他说好了
I made a deal with him,

345
00:14:47,160 --> 00:14:49,420
再说  那样对你不公平
and besides, that wouldn't be fair to you.

346
00:14:49,420 --> 00:14:50,430
实际上  我挺想他的
Well, actually, I miss him.

347
00:14:50,430 --> 00:14:51,740
他最近都泡在那边
He's been over there a lot.

348
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:54,180
太好了  那告诉他他可以回来了
Well, great. Tell him he can come back.

349
00:14:54,180 --> 00:14:56,730
不行  他在为我和我的感受着想
I can't. He's thinking of me and my feelings

350
00:14:56,730 --> 00:14:58,140
他想尊重我
and trying to be respectful.

351
00:14:58,140 --> 00:15:01,080
他也是那样对我的  那混蛋
That's what he's doing to me, too, the jerk!

352
00:15:01,870 --> 00:15:03,400
别再露出那眼神了
Stop that.

353
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:09,010
你生气的表情和谢尔顿便秘的表情是一样的
Hey, your mad look and Sheldon's constipated look are the same.

354
00:15:16,220 --> 00:15:17,420
这感觉真好
This is nice.

355
00:15:17,420 --> 00:15:18,710
是的
It is.

356
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:23,230
她以前也是这样吻我的
She used to kiss me like that.

357
00:15:24,660 --> 00:15:25,930
你还好吧
You okay?

358
00:15:26,930 --> 00:15:30,160
没事  抱歉
Yeah. Yeah, I'm sorry.

359
00:15:30,430 --> 00:15:31,690
没事
Yeah.

360
00:15:33,650 --> 00:15:35,880
老天啊  我好孤单啊
Oh, God, I'm so alone.

361
00:15:35,880 --> 00:15:37,540
抱歉  我没办法
Sorry, I can't do this.

362
00:15:37,630 --> 00:15:39,260
怎么了
What's going on?

363
00:15:40,050 --> 00:15:42,290
我前几天遇到奥利弗了
I met Oliver the other day.

364
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:44,580
等等  你去找我老公了吗
Wait, you tracked down my husband?

365
00:15:44,580 --> 00:15:46,090
不是  那多奇怪啊
No, that would be weird.

366
00:15:46,090 --> 00:15:49,090
是他来找我  然后我们共度了一晚
He tracked me down, then we spent the evening together.

367
00:15:50,030 --> 00:15:51,750
真难以置信
I don't believe this.

368
00:15:51,750 --> 00:15:54,850
他那样做都是因为他在乎你
He-he only did it because he cares about you.

369
00:15:54,850 --> 00:15:57,830
不  是因为他占有欲强  又爱吃醋
No, he did it because he's possessive and jealous.

370
00:15:57,830 --> 00:15:59,050
真的吗  我完全没看出来
Really? I didn't get that at all.

371
00:15:59,050 --> 00:16:01,790
他让我感到很舒服自在
He made me feel very comfortable.

372
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:04,260
你俩"基"出火花  我倍感欣慰啊
Well, I'm glad you two hit it off.

373
00:16:04,260 --> 00:16:07,660
其实  我觉得你对他不公平
You know, I don't think that you're being very fair to him.

374
00:16:07,660 --> 00:16:09,390
你站他那边吗
You're taking his side?

375
00:16:09,390 --> 00:16:11,360
没有  但我要指出
No, but I should point out that

376
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:15,600
他提议过做婚姻咨询  所以至少他在努力挽回
he did offer to go to counseling, so at least one of you is trying.

377
00:16:15,740 --> 00:16:17,370
你比他还神经病
You're crazier than he is.

378
00:16:17,380 --> 00:16:20,470
这样吧  你再给他一次机会
I'll tell you what, just give him one more chance

379
00:16:20,470 --> 00:16:21,730
如果还是不成功
and if it doesn't work out,

380
00:16:21,730 --> 00:16:24,970
我很乐意继续和你打炮
I'll be happy to keep sleeping with you.

381
00:16:26,060 --> 00:16:28,120
你很乐意是吧
You would?

382
00:16:28,890 --> 00:16:30,930
不管哪种结果  你都会有男人
Either way, you've got yourself a fella.

383
00:16:30,930 --> 00:16:33,570
这多棒啊
Like, how nice is that?

384
00:16:37,940 --> 00:16:39,450
谢尔顿
Hey, Sheldon.

385
00:16:42,170 --> 00:16:43,010
你好
Hello.

386
00:16:43,010 --> 00:16:47,290
你的合同规定有三天试用期
So, your contract provides for a three-day trial period,

387
00:16:47,290 --> 00:16:49,290
我觉得这事还是行不通
and I don't think this is working out.

388
00:16:49,290 --> 00:16:50,870
所以  用法律术语来说
So, to put it in legal terms,

389
00:16:50,870 --> 00:16:52,830
就是合同甲方
the party of the first part would like

390
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:55,780
希望合同乙方滚蛋
the party of the second part to get out.

391
00:16:57,170 --> 00:16:59,830
试用期几点结束
What time does the trial period end?

392
00:16:59,830 --> 00:17:00,870
中午12点
12:00, noon.

393
00:17:00,870 --> 00:17:03,820
那后面还写了什么
Yeah-- what does it say after that?

394
00:17:07,550 --> 00:17:13,120
剧中主角所在的西部比东部慢三小时

395
00:17:07,550 --> 00:17:09,640
东部标准时间
Eastern Standard Time.

396
00:17:11,130 --> 00:17:13,120
那是3小时前的事了
That was three hours ago.

397
00:17:13,270 --> 00:17:16,310
既然你没有行使废除合约的权利
And, uh, since you didn't exercise your right to revoke,

398
00:17:16,310 --> 00:17:19,100
我要行使我的权利来延长合约
I exercised my right to extend,

399
00:17:19,100 --> 00:17:23,730
这令这份超详细的租赁合同开始生效
triggering this long-form rental agreement...

400
00:17:24,840 --> 00:17:27,210
而你已经违反了上面的条约
...of which you're already in violation.

401
00:17:27,840 --> 00:17:29,720
这不过是一堆纸张
This is just a-a bunch of paper.

402
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:31,750
你无法强制执行
You can't enforce this.

403
00:17:31,750 --> 00:17:34,040
请个律师  我们见分晓
Hire a lawyer. Let's find out.

404
00:17:35,580 --> 00:17:37,190
这事不是真的
This is not happening.

405
00:17:37,190 --> 00:17:38,210
随你怎么想
Be that as it may,

406
00:17:38,210 --> 00:17:40,160
但第九页写着你得为我提供
page nine says that you have to provide me

407
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:43,800
柠檬味的气泡水  所以赶紧的
with lemon-flavored sparkling waters, so... chop-chop.

408
00:17:48,700 --> 00:17:49,650
结果如何
Hey, how'd it go?

409
00:17:49,650 --> 00:17:51,910
显然他是不会走了
Well, apparently he's not leaving

410
00:17:51,910 --> 00:17:55,060
而我还得给他弄气泡水来
and I have to go get him sparkling water.

411
00:17:56,020 --> 00:17:57,670
你为什么在笑
Why are you smiling?

412
00:17:57,680 --> 00:18:01,180
我也不知道  就是感觉对了
I don't know. It just feels right.

413
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,770
漫步群星之中
...through the stars.

414
00:18:17,850 --> 00:18:19,910
你好啊  兄弟
Hey, buddy.

415
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:21,300
我和妮尔谈过了
I talked to Nell.

416
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:23,270
你走了之后她很不高兴
She was pretty upset after you left.

417
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:25,990
-我很抱歉  -不  不不
- Yeah, I'm sorry. - No. No, no, no.

418
00:18:25,990 --> 00:18:28,140
她说你说了一些很诡异变态的话
She told me that you said something so creepy

419
00:18:28,140 --> 00:18:30,420
相比之下  我显得很棒
that I seemed great in comparison.

420
00:18:31,110 --> 00:18:33,180
我知道是哪句话
I know exactly what it was.

421
00:18:33,180 --> 00:18:33,630
不  其实
I... no, actually,

422
00:18:33,630 --> 00:18:35,020
有几句都有可能
there was a couple of things it could've been.

423
00:18:35,020 --> 00:18:38,060
无论是哪句  都很诡异变态
Whichever one it was, it was creepy.

424
00:18:38,210 --> 00:18:40,400
总之  我去安慰了她
Anyway, uh, I went over to comfort her,

425
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:44,140
我们谈了一下  貌似我们会再给彼此一次机会
and we talked, and I think we're gonna give it another chance.

426
00:18:44,140 --> 00:18:47,450
我真为你高兴
I'm so happy for you!

427
00:18:47,450 --> 00:18:49,720
我们应该庆祝一下
We should celebrate.

428
00:18:49,730 --> 00:18:50,680
去馅饼屋吗
House of Pies?

429
00:18:50,690 --> 00:18:52,450
那还用说吗
You know it.

430
00:18:55,520 --> 00:18:56,900
要叫上妮尔吗
Should we invite Nell?

431
00:18:56,900 --> 00:18:58,030
有必要吗
Do we have to?

432
00:18:58,030 --> 00:19:00,260
算了吧
Nah.

